    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f\u00a0Welcome to the Dump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Wife Threw Out My Card Collection (So I Bought a Dump to Find Them All)</strong> is a cozy, slightly deranged trash-diving simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through mountains of junk, uncover lost streamer-themed cards, and rebuild your collection one foil at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once discarded is now treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf\u00a0Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Dig, sort, collect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trash pile is a chance to recover something amazing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd33 <strong>Streamer Trading Cards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From familiar faces to outrageous parodies of internet legends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Humor, nostalgia &amp; trashy beauty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where garbage tells stories \u2014 and the rarest finds hide under the weirdest stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>No battles. Just garbage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a dream. And maybe a little obsession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0Who\u2019s it for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of simulator games, cozy vibes, internet humor, and the eternal joy of finding something you thought was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially those with <strong>cardboard in their soul.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f\u00a0Welcome to the Dump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Wife Threw Out My Card Collection (So I Bought a Dump to Find Them All)</strong> is a cozy, slightly deranged trash-diving simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through mountains of junk, uncover lost streamer-themed cards, and rebuild your collection one foil at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once discarded is now treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf\u00a0Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Dig, sort, collect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trash pile is a chance to recover something amazing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd33 <strong>Streamer Trading Cards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From familiar faces to outrageous parodies of internet legends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Humor, nostalgia &amp; trashy beauty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where garbage tells stories \u2014 and the rarest finds hide under the weirdest stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>No battles. Just garbage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a dream. And maybe a little obsession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0Who\u2019s it for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of simulator games, cozy vibes, internet humor, and the eternal joy of finding something you thought was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially those with <strong>cardboard in their soul.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "One trash run \u2014 and it was all gone. Now it\u2019s just you, a cart, and a thousand tons of garbage. But you\u2019ll keep digging through every pile, searching for rare cards and nostalgic treasure. In this cozy trash-cleaning simulator.",
